{"repo": {"name": {"en-US": "Steve的F-Droid仓库"}, "description": {"en-US": "Steve 个人维护的 F-Droid 仓库，收录 AppSpace 与票据 App。"}, "icon": {"en-US": {"name": "/icons/steve-github-avatar.png", "sha256": "b3debfd523b8a06d2633169cd576db78a284ea6281304cbcb9bc688c572acd7d", "size": 47810}}, "address": "https://steve0309.dpdns.org/fdroid/repo", "timestamp": 1792548799000, "categories": {"System": {"name": {"en-US": "System"}}, "Travel & Local": {"name": {"en-US": "Travel & Local"}}}}, "packages": {"com.example.appspace": {"metadata": {"added": 1792548789000, "categories": ["System"], "issueTracker": "https://github.com/SteveYuanlong9321/AppSpace/issues", "lastUpdated": 1792548789000, "license": "Apache-2.0", "sourceCode": "https://github.com/SteveYuanlong9321/AppSpace", "webSite": "https://steveyuanlong9321.github.io/AppSpace/", "authorName": "SteveYuanlong9321", "name": {"en-US": "AppSpace", "zh-CN": "AppSpace"}, "summary": {"en-US": "Search Android apps across multiple app catalogs", "zh-CN": "聚合搜索多个来源的 Android 应用"}, "description": {"en-US": "AppSpace brings multiple third-party Android app catalogs into one search interface.\n\nFeatures:\n* Search F-Droid, GitHub Releases, Huawei AppGallery, vivo App Store, and Uptodown\n* Rank results by relevance when source metadata allows it\n* View app details and available version information\n* Compare available download sources for matching apps\n* Download APKs and use Android's installation flow\n* No AppSpace account or sign-in required\n\nImportant notes:\n* Catalog availability and download links are controlled by third-party services and may change.\n* Search results do not guarantee that a working APK is available.\n* Before installing an APK, verify the app name, developer, package name, and download source.\n* Downloads from outside F-Droid have not been checked or built by F-Droid. Use care when choosing external sources.\n* The optional Shizuku-assisted installation flow is experimental and requires separate setup and authorization.\n\nAppSpace currently uses F-Droid as one of its search sources. This does not mean AppSpace itself is already included in the official F-Droid repository.", "zh-CN": "AppSpace（应用空间）将多个第三方 Android 应用目录整合到一个搜索界面中。\n\n主要功能：\n* 搜索 F-Droid、GitHub Releases、华为应用市场、vivo 应用商店和 Uptodown\n* 在来源提供足够信息时，按关键词相关性排序\n* 查看应用详情及来源提供的版本信息\n* 对同一应用可识别的多个下载来源进行选择\n* 下载 APK，并交由 Android 系统安装\n* 无需注册或登录 AppSpace 账户\n\n请注意：\n* 应用目录的可用性和下载链接由第三方服务维护，可能发生变化。\n* 搜索结果不保证一定提供可用的 APK。\n* 安装前请核对应用名称、开发者、包名和下载来源。\n* 从 F-Droid 以外的来源下载的 APK 并未经过 F-Droid 的检查或构建，请谨慎选择来源。\n* 可选的 Shizuku 辅助安装功能仍属实验性功能，需要单独设置并授权。\n\nAppSpace 将 F-Droid 作为其中一个应用搜索来源；这并不代表 AppSpace 已经被收录进 F-Droid 官方仓库。"}, "icon": {"en-US": {"name": "/com.example.appspace/en-US/icon_XVDRL8D-7hsUlUb0YdLsVBICT5RQFWMqCOpGbMOmj9o=.png", "sha256": "5d50d12fc0feee1b149546f461d2ec5412024f945015632a08ea466cc3a68fda", "size": 162231}, "zh-CN": {"name": "/com.example.appspace/zh-CN/icon_XVDRL8D-7hsUlUb0YdLsVBICT5RQFWMqCOpGbMOmj9o=.png", "sha256": "5d50d12fc0feee1b149546f461d2ec5412024f945015632a08ea466cc3a68fda", "size": 162231}}, "preferredSigner": "9e6a291675cb515875753864b940c038d7f06fe8e2e2b82a32363b064d4b4756"}, "versions": {"1b22ca2376918eda0ab928137d5d1c711aab684265d0494591464d9a2cfd58da": {"added": 1792548789000, "file": {"name": "/appspace-v1.0-app-release.apk", "sha256": "1b22ca2376918eda0ab928137d5d1c711aab684265d0494591464d9a2cfd58da", "size": 12846789}, "manifest": {"nativecode": ["arm64-v8a", "armeabi-v7a", "x86", "x86_64"], "versionName": "1.0", "versionCode": 1, "usesSdk": {"minSdkVersion": 26, "targetSdkVersion": 37}, "signer": {"sha256": ["9e6a291675cb515875753864b940c038d7f06fe8e2e2b82a32363b064d4b4756"]}, "usesPermission": [{"name": "android.permission.INTERNET"}, {"name": "android.permission.REQUEST_INSTALL_PACKAGES"}, {"name": "android.permission.POST_NOTIFICATIONS"}, {"name": "android.permission.QUERY_ALL_PACKAGES"}, {"name": "com.example.appspace.DYNAMIC_RECEIVER_NOT_EXPORTED_PERMISSION"}, {"name": "moe.shizuku.manager.permission.API_V23"}]}, "antiFeatures": {"NonFreeNet": {}}}}}, "com.example.tickets": {"metadata": {"added": 1792548789000, "categories": ["Travel & Local"], "issueTracker": "https://github.com/SteveYuanlong9321/Tickets/issues", "lastUpdated": 1792548792000, "sourceCode": "https://github.com/SteveYuanlong9321/Tickets", "webSite": "https://steve0309.dpdns.org/tickets/", "authorName": "SteveYuanlong9321", "name": {"en-US": "票据"}, "summary": {"en-US": "电子票据管理与设备间传票"}, "description": {"en-US": "Tickets 是一款 Android 电子票据管理应用。\n\n用于本地管理车票、机票、演出和门票等电子凭证，并支持设备之间传票。\n当前发布版本保持完整功能，包括用户可选择的设备间传输连接方式以及实时通知功能。\n\n官方项目：\nhttps://github.com/SteveYuanlong9321/Tickets\n"}, "icon": {"en-US": {"name": "/com.example.tickets/en-US/icon_cwRFb8c0wgEQCIPA-3V6tmOfonVnkiDEzwHKLHSo8WI=.png", "sha256": "7304456fc734c201100883c0fb757ab6639fa275679220c4cf01ca2c74a8f162", "size": 1627740}}, "preferredSigner": "446fb075f5974f0c2dd8c3327cc4c10dd89b93accf6a37209532990554d1c585"}, "versions": {"9cd5903185bb39f0ca98378ee8ad050beca954d4ea0bf09d3869f0a8c53ea15f": {"added": 1792548792000, "file": {"name": "/v7.0.0-app-release.apk", "sha256": "9cd5903185bb39f0ca98378ee8ad050beca954d4ea0bf09d3869f0a8c53ea15f", "size": 90897166}, "manifest": {"nativecode": ["arm64-v8a", "armeabi-v7a", "x86", "x86_64"], "versionName": "7.0.0", "versionCode": 700, "usesSdk": {"minSdkVersion": 26, "targetSdkVersion": 37}, "signer": {"sha256": ["446fb075f5974f0c2dd8c3327cc4c10dd89b93accf6a37209532990554d1c585"]}, "usesPermission": [{"name": "android.permission.POST_NOTIFICATIONS"}, {"name": "android.permission.POST_PROMOTED_NOTIFICATIONS"}, {"name": "android.permission.CAMERA"}, {"name": "android.permission.READ_MEDIA_IMAGES"}, {"name": "android.permission.READ_MEDIA_VIDEO"}, {"name": "android.permission.READ_MEDIA_VISUAL_USER_SELECTED"}, {"name": "android.permission.READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE", "maxSdkVersion": 32}, {"name": "android.permission.RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED"}, {"name": "android.permission.INTERNET"}, {"name": "android.permi